  "passage": {
    "text": "A company must send a big cargo from China to Lithuania. It can use a plane, a ship, a train or a truck. A plane is the fastest, but it is also the most expensive. A ship is slower, but it is much cheaper. The cargo goes in a container, and the container travels to a port. A train is faster than a ship and cheaper than a plane. A truck is the best choice for short distances. The logistics manager compares the cost and the speed. Then she chooses the best way.",
